<div data-cgap-sector="Car Washes &amp; Truck Washes" data-cgap-term="car wash"></div><p class="lead">A car wash mixes customers, moving conveyors, high-pressure water and chemicals in one building. Customers need clear instructions in the bay and at the tunnel entrance, and staff need warnings in the equipment room and at the pump station.</p><p>These signs cover self-serve bays, vacuum islands, tunnel conveyors and correlators, wrap and top brushes, high-pressure pump stations, reclaim systems and truck and bus wash bays. Aluminum does not rust in a wet tunnel the way steel or plastic signs fail.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Self-serve car wash bay</h3><p>40 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the bay wall next to the floor drain grate.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-self-serve-bay-floor-drain-grate-sign-cgap-c01093-812">Self-Serve Bay Floor Drain Grate</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-high-pressure-wand-sign-cgap-c01228-812">High Pressure Wand</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-bay-wand-hose-on-floor-sign-cgap-c01363-812">Bay Wand Hose on Floor</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-foaming-brush-solution-sign-cgap-c01498-812">Foaming Brush Solution</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Car wash vacuum system</h3><p>35 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the vacuum island column at hose height.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-vacuum-island-hose-sign-cgap-c12338-812">Vacuum Island Hose</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-vacuum-island-canopy-sign-cgap-c12473-812">Vacuum Island Canopy</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-vacuum-island-hose-boom-sign-cgap-c12608-812">Vacuum Island Hose Boom</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-vacuum-nozzle-tool-sign-cgap-c12743-812">Vacuum Nozzle Tool</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pressure washer or surface cleaner</h3><p>33 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the washer frame near the gun holder.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pressure-washer-spray-gun-sign-cgap-c18219-812">Pressure Washer Spray Gun</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pressure-washer-engine-sign-cgap-c18350-812">Pressure Washer Engine</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pressure-washer-pull-start-sign-cgap-c18481-812">Pressure Washer Pull Start</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pressure-washer-hot-water-spray-sign-cgap-c18612-812">Pressure Washer Hot Water Spray</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Tunnel conveyor</h3><p>28 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Entrance guide-on area at tunnel mouth.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-tunnel-conveyor-load-zone-sign-8x12-aluminum">Tunnel Conveyor Load Zone</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-tunnel-conveyor-entrance-sign-cgap-c01091-812">Tunnel Conveyor Entrance</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-tunnel-conveyor-load-zone-sign-cgap-i01091-812">Tunnel Conveyor Load Zone</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-stalled-car-in-tunnel-sign-8x12-aluminum">Stalled Car in Tunnel</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>High-pressure pump station</h3><p>27 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the wall next to the pump room drain.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pump-room-floor-drain-sign-cgap-c10048-812">Pump Room Floor Drain</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pump-booster-tank-sign-cgap-c10183-812">Pump Booster Tank</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pump-hose-connection-sign-cgap-c10318-812">Pump Hose Connection</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pump-water-softener-salt-sign-cgap-c10453-812">Pump Water Softener Salt</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Wrap and top brushes</h3><p>24 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the wall or post beside the brush wash down at eye level where the hazard is first reached.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-brush-wash-down-sign-cgap-c10046-812">Brush Wash Down</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-brush-cloth-trim-sign-cgap-c10181-812">Brush Cloth Trim</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-wrap-around-brush-sign-cgap-c06276-812">Wrap Around Brush</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-top-brush-arm-sign-cgap-c06411-812">Top Brush Arm</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Water reclaim system</h3><p>23 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the wall or post beside the reclaim tank lid at eye level where the hazard is first reached.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-reclaim-tank-lid-sign-cgap-c15221-812">Reclaim Tank Lid</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-reclaim-pit-cover-sign-cgap-c15355-812">Reclaim Pit Cover</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-reclaim-pump-sign-cgap-c15489-812">Reclaim Pump</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-reclaim-tank-ladder-sign-cgap-c15623-812">Reclaim Tank Ladder</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Equipment room</h3><p>21 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the wall or post beside the equipment room door at eye level where the hazard is first reached.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-equipment-room-door-sign-cgap-c19066-812">Equipment Room Door</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-equipment-room-door-sign-cgap-i16219-812">Equipment Room Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-equipment-room-floor-sign-cgap-c19192-812">Equipment Room Floor</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-equipment-room-step-sign-cgap-c19316-812">Equipment Room Step</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>Will these signs survive constant water and chemicals?</summary><p>They are rust-resistant aluminum with UV-stable print, made for wet bays and outdoor islands.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have customer-facing signs for self-serve bays?</summary><p>Yes, including bay instructions and pressure wand warnings. Search &quot;self-serve bay&quot; to see them.</p></details><details><summary>What about the equipment room?</summary><p>There are signs for pump stations, chemical storage, reclaim tanks and lockout points. Search &quot;car wash equipment room&quot;.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Will these signs survive constant water and chemicals?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "They are rust-resistant aluminum with UV-stable print, made for wet bays and outdoor islands."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have customer-facing signs for self-serve bays?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including bay instructions and pressure wand warnings. Search \"self-serve bay\" to see them."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What about the equipment room?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "There are signs for pump stations, chemical storage, reclaim tanks and lockout points. Search \"car wash equipment room\"."}}]}</script>